    <content type="html">&lt;h2&gt;What&#39;s Changed&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;feat(comm): copy-engine based kernel for the PCIe IPC all-reduce by &lt;a class=&quot;user-mention notranslate&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;user&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/users/qsang-nv/hovercard&quot; data-octo-click=&quot;hovercard-link-click&quot; data-octo-dimensions=&quot;link_type:self&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/qsang-nv&quot;&gt;@qsang-nv&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5308999956&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/flashinfer-ai/flashinfer/issues/4870&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/flashinfer-ai/flashinfer/pull/4870/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/flashinfer-ai/flashinfer/pull/4870&quot;&gt;#4870&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
