    <id>tag:github.com,2008:Repository/669331976/v0.7.0</id>
    <updated>2026-09-23T17:20:20Z</updated>
    <link rel="alternate" type="text/html" href="https://github.com/flashinfer-ai/flashinfer/releases/tag/v0.7.0"/>
    <title>Release v0.7.0</title>
    <content type="html">&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;These highlights are also published at &lt;a href=&quot;https://flashinfer.ai/releases/#v0-7-0&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;flashinfer.ai/releases&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;v0.7.0 Highlights&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;FlashInfer 0.7.0 makes the unified mixture-of-experts (MoE) API official, brings TRT-LLM Gen MoE kernels into readable Python source with PrimTS, and introduces Autotuner v2 and a formal experimental-API policy. It also expands sparse and linear attention, expert-parallel serving, and diffusion workloads across Blackwell GPUs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Read the &lt;a href=&quot;https://flashinfer.ai/2026/09/22/flashinfer-v07.html&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;v0.7 overview&lt;/a&gt; and the accompanying deep dives on &lt;a href=&quot;https://flashinfer.ai/2026/09/22/mega-moe.html&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;MegaMoE&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://flashinfer.ai/2026/09/22/autotuner-v2.html&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;Autotuner v2&lt;/a&gt;, and the &lt;a href=&quot;https://flashinfer.ai/2026/09/22/experimental-path.html&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;experimental path&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Unified MoE API is official&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;code&gt;MoELayer&lt;/code&gt; is now an official FlashInfer API, with the lower-level kernel entry points supported alongside it. &lt;code&gt;QuantConfig&lt;/code&gt; gives weights, activations, and output explicit &lt;code&gt;QuantFormat&lt;/code&gt; fields: &lt;code&gt;QuantConfig(weight=QuantFormat.MXFP4)&lt;/code&gt; selects MXFP4 weights with BF16 activations, while adding &lt;code&gt;activation=QuantFormat.MXFP8&lt;/code&gt; selects W4A8. Backend coverage expands with quantization-specific CUTLASS runners, cuTile BF16 and NVFP4 MoE, and CuTe-DSL BF16 MoE on Hopper.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5445199204&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/flashinfer-ai/flashinfer/issues/5200&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/flashinfer-ai/flashinfer/pull/5200/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/flashinfer-ai/flashinfer/pull/5200&quot;&gt;#5200&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5344793114&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/flashinfer-ai/flashinfer/issues/4952&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/flashinfer-ai/flashinfer/pull/4952/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/flashinfer-ai/flashinfer/pull/4952&quot;&gt;#4952&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5399776710&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/flashinfer-ai/flashinfer/issues/5061&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/flashinfer-ai/flashinfer/pull/5061/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/flashinfer-ai/flashinfer/pull/5061&quot;&gt;#5061&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5190371275&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/flashinfer-ai/flashinfer/issues/4610&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/flashinfer-ai/flashinfer/pull/4610/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/flashinfer-ai/flashinfer/pull/4610&quot;&gt;#4610&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5208543786&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/flashinfer-ai/flashinfer/issues/4646&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/flashinfer-ai/flashinfer/pull/4646/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/flashinfer-ai/flashinfer/pull/4646&quot;&gt;#4646&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5315048432&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/flashinfer-ai/flashinfer/issues/4878&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/flashinfer-ai/flashinfer/pull/4878/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/flashinfer-ai/flashinfer/pull/4878&quot;&gt;#4878&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;TRT-LLM Gen MoE kernels as Python source with PrimTS&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The experimental PrimTS MoE backend exposes kernels built with the CUTLASS DSL Primitives and Task Scheduling APIs, making the expert GEMMs available as readable Python source. It supports BF16, per-tensor and block-scaled FP8, and NVFP4/MXFP4 combinations, while reusing TRT-LLM Gen routing and finalization. Accuracy qualification targets B200; B300 qualification is still pending, and supported configurations have backend-specific restrictions. PrimTS attention also gains paged block-sparse attention, variable-window attention, and a unified &lt;code&gt;plan()&lt;/code&gt;/&lt;code&gt;run()&lt;/code&gt; contract for reusable wrappers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5073391571&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/flashinfer-ai/flashinfer/issues/4361&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/flashinfer-ai/flashinfer/pull/4361/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/flashinfer-ai/flashinfer/pull/4361&quot;&gt;#4361&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5126641736&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/flashinfer-ai/flashinfer/issues/4474&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/flashinfer-ai/flashinfer/pull/4474/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/flashinfer-ai/flashinfer/pull/4474&quot;&gt;#4474&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5188385485&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/flashinfer-ai/flashinfer/issues/4599&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/flashinfer-ai/flashinfer/pull/4599/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/flashinfer-ai/flashinfer/pull/4599&quot;&gt;#4599&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5296073262&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/flashinfer-ai/flashinfer/issues/4829&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/flashinfer-ai/flashinfer/pull/4829/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/flashinfer-ai/flashinfer/pull/4829&quot;&gt;#4829&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Autotuner v2 tunes the way you serve&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;code&gt;autotune_v2()&lt;/code&gt; lets applications measure candidates in eager or CUDA-graph execution and persist the results in an environment-specific cache managed by FlashInfer. Atomic cache entries support concurrent rank writes, and &lt;code&gt;autotune_v2_reload()&lt;/code&gt; lets homogeneous ranks converge on shared results. In the &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/flashinfer-ai/flashinfer/issues/3920#issuecomment-5590875709&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;issue&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/flashinfer-ai/flashinfer/issues/3920/hovercard&quot;&gt;reported vLLM validation&lt;/a&gt;, Qwen3-8B-FP8 at TP2 on B200 reduced its tuning window from 128 seconds on a cold start to 1 second on restart with the same cache; total startup was 410.7 seconds and 165.3 seconds, respectively. Applications opt in through the new API; &lt;code&gt;autotune()&lt;/code&gt; remains available.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4826613742&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/flashinfer-ai/flashinfer/issues/3861&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/flashinfer-ai/flashinfer/pull/3861/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/flashinfer-ai/flashinfer/pull/3861&quot;&gt;#3861&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experimental APIs and backends have an explicit opt-in path&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experimental APIs are marked with &lt;code&gt;@flashinfer_experimental_api&lt;/code&gt;, and experimental backends have a dedicated &lt;code&gt;flashinfer.experimental&lt;/code&gt; namespace. Calling an experimental API or explicitly selecting a marked backend emits a warning; automatic selection includes marked experimental backends only when &lt;code&gt;FLASHINFER_ALLOW_EXPERIMENTAL_AUTO_BACKENDS=1&lt;/code&gt; is set. The policy defines admission and graduation criteria and keeps experimental implementations JIT-only, outside prebuilt packages.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5316609243&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/flashinfer-ai/flashinfer/issues/4880&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/flashinfer-ai/flashinfer/pull/4880/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/flashinfer-ai/flashinfer/pull/4880&quot;&gt;#4880&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Expert-parallel MoE expands across Blackwell&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;code&gt;moe_ep&lt;/code&gt; adds an unquantized BF16 MegaMoE backend and a W4A8 split backend on B200, with MXFP8-packed dispatch for the latter. RTX PRO 6000 and DGX Spark gain an MXFP8 MegaMoE backend with functional correctness validated and performance tuning ongoing. The NCCL-EP split path supports CUDA-graph capture through a reusable handle with per-step &lt;code&gt;update()&lt;/code&gt;, validated through vLLM on four B200 GPUs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5085762956&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/flashinfer-ai/flashinfer/issues/4386&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/flashinfer-ai/flashinfer/pull/4386/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/flashinfer-ai/flashinfer/pull/4386&quot;&gt;#4386&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5158531777&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/flashinfer-ai/flashinfer/issues/4529&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/flashinfer-ai/flashinfer/pull/4529/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/flashinfer-ai/flashinfer/pull/4529&quot;&gt;#4529&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5085764225&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/flashinfer-ai/flashinfer/issues/4387&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/flashinfer-ai/flashinfer/pull/4387/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/flashinfer-ai/flashinfer/pull/4387&quot;&gt;#4387&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5274885631&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/flashinfer-ai/flashinfer/issues/4795&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/flashinfer-ai/flashinfer/pull/4795/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/flashinfer-ai/flashinfer/pull/4795&quot;&gt;#4795&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;DeepSeek-V4 and MiniMax-M3 sparse attention&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Blackwell gains paged FP8/MXFP4 indexer logits and more top-K choices, including a CUB backend with variable-length support. DeepSeek-V4 Flash sparse MLA supports an NVFP4 KV cache on SM120/SM121 through &lt;code&gt;kv_cache_format=&quot;nvfp4&quot;&lt;/code&gt;. MiniMax-M3 sparse attention gains source-distributed CAKE-generated kernels on SM100/SM103; the B200 kernel benchmark reports a 2.45× geometric-mean speedup over the MiniMax baseline across 11 comparable prefill, decode, speculative, and boundary cases.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5077183221&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/flashinfer-ai/flashinfer/issues/4365&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/flashinfer-ai/flashinfer/pull/4365/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/flashinfer-ai/flashinfer/pull/4365&quot;&gt;#4365&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5281912576&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/flashinfer-ai/flashinfer/issues/4811&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/flashinfer-ai/flashinfer/pull/4811/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/flashinfer-ai/flashinfer/pull/4811&quot;&gt;#4811&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5195932706&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/flashinfer-ai/flashinfer/issues/4621&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/flashinfer-ai/flashinfer/pull/4621/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/flashinfer-ai/flashinfer/pull/4621&quot;&gt;#4621&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5110751610&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/flashinfer-ai/flashinfer/issues/4442&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/flashinfer-ai/flashinfer/pull/4442/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/flashinfer-ai/flashinfer/pull/4442&quot;&gt;#4442&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5346035169&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/flashinfer-ai/flashinfer/issues/4955&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/flashinfer-ai/flashinfer/pull/4955/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/flashinfer-ai/flashinfer/pull/4955&quot;&gt;#4955&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5069177406&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/flashinfer-ai/flashinfer/issues/4355&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/flashinfer-ai/flashinfer/pull/4355/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/flashinfer-ai/flashinfer/pull/4355&quot;&gt;#4355&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Linear attention for Kimi K3, Qwen 3.6, and Nemotron-H&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Kimi K3 gains a speculative-verification entry point compatible with vLLM&#39;s recurrent verifier, plus CuTe-DSL recurrent prefill on B200/B300 and SM120. The experimental &lt;code&gt;RecurrentKDAPrefillWrapper&lt;/code&gt; supports planning and graph-safe prefix checkpoints. Qwen 3.6 gains experimental fused GDN decode steps on SM120 that combine projection, convolution, gating, and recurrent state updates. Nemotron-H gains source-built Mamba SSD-combined and selective-state-update backends on B200/GB300.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5239539961&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/flashinfer-ai/flashinfer/issues/4709&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/flashinfer-ai/flashinfer/pull/4709/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/flashinfer-ai/flashinfer/pull/4709&quot;&gt;#4709&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5189182464&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/flashinfer-ai/flashinfer/issues/4605&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/flashinfer-ai/flashinfer/pull/4605/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/flashinfer-ai/flashinfer/pull/4605&quot;&gt;#4605&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5200624621&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/flashinfer-ai/flashinfer/issues/4633&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/flashinfer-ai/flashinfer/pull/4633/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/flashinfer-ai/flashinfer/pull/4633&quot;&gt;#4633&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5382350325&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/flashinfer-ai/flashinfer/issues/5021&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/flashinfer-ai/flashinfer/pull/5021/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/flashinfer-ai/flashinfer/pull/5021&quot;&gt;#5021&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5392989012&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/flashinfer-ai/flashinfer/issues/5040&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/flashinfer-ai/flashinfer/pull/5040/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/flashinfer-ai/flashinfer/pull/5040&quot;&gt;#5040&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5133241958&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/flashinfer-ai/flashinfer/issues/4481&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/flashinfer-ai/flashinfer/pull/4481/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/flashinfer-ai/flashinfer/pull/4481&quot;&gt;#4481&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5238520960&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/flashinfer-ai/flashinfer/issues/4708&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/flashinfer-ai/flashinfer/pull/4708/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/flashinfer-ai/flashinfer/pull/4708&quot;&gt;#4708&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5177506832&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/flashinfer-ai/flashinfer/issues/4576&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/flashinfer-ai/flashinfer/pull/4576/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/flashinfer-ai/flashinfer/pull/4576&quot;&gt;#4576&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5191773998&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/flashinfer-ai/flashinfer/issues/4616&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/flashinfer-ai/flashinfer/pull/4616/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/flashinfer-ai/flashinfer/pull/4616&quot;&gt;#4616&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diffusion and video attention on Blackwell&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Video Sparse Attention gains generated SM100/SM103 kernels, and the block-64 path adds a native CuTe-DSL implementation with Sage FP8 support. SM120 gains a generated Sage block-sparse backend and an optimized NVFP4 attention path for Cosmos workloads. MiniMax-H3 gains a prepared MXFP8 pre-attention pipeline on B200/B300, while PrimTS block-sparse attention adds proxy compensation for Sol-Attn workloads.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5185261370&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/flashinfer-ai/flashinfer/issues/4593&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/flashinfer-ai/flashinfer/pull/4593/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/flashinfer-ai/flashinfer/pull/4593&quot;&gt;#4593&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5190855977&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/flashinfer-ai/flashinfer/issues/4612&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/flashinfer-ai/flashinfer/pull/4612/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/flashinfer-ai/flashinfer/pull/4612&quot;&gt;#4612&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5344780375&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/flashinfer-ai/flashinfer/issues/4951&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/flashinfer-ai/flashinfer/pull/4951/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/flashinfer-ai/flashinfer/pull/4951&quot;&gt;#4951&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5143166854&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/flashinfer-ai/flashinfer/issues/4502&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/flashinfer-ai/flashinfer/pull/4502/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/flashinfer-ai/flashinfer/pull/4502&quot;&gt;#4502&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5399707542&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/flashinfer-ai/flashinfer/issues/5060&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/flashinfer-ai/flashinfer/pull/5060/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/flashinfer-ai/flashinfer/pull/5060&quot;&gt;#5060&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5309666033&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/flashinfer-ai/flashinfer/issues/4872&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/flashinfer-ai/flashinfer/pull/4872/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/flashinfer-ai/flashinfer/pull/4872&quot;&gt;#4872&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Communication for PCIe and NVLink deployments&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;code&gt;PcieIpcAllReduceWorkspace&lt;/code&gt; adds an intra-node CUDA-IPC all-reduce for two, four, or eight ranks on PCIe machines without NVLink. Blackwell fused all-gather matmul gains a &lt;code&gt;backend=&quot;cake&quot;&lt;/code&gt; option and a prepared callable for packed-QKV workloads, with tensor parallelism up to eight GPUs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5087401894&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/flashinfer-ai/flashinfer/issues/4393&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/flashinfer-ai/flashinfer/pull/4393/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/flashinfer-ai/flashinfer/pull/4393&quot;&gt;#4393&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5245001851&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/flashinfer-ai/flashinfer/issues/4722&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/flashinfer-ai/flashinfer/pull/4722/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/flashinfer-ai/flashinfer/pull/4722&quot;&gt;#4722&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5289952747&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/flashinfer-ai/flashinfer/issues/4822&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/flashinfer-ai/flashinfer/pull/4822/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/flashinfer-ai/flashinfer/pull/4822&quot;&gt;#4822&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Notice: packaging and dependencies&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;code&gt;flashinfer-jit-cache&lt;/code&gt; is now a small shim that depends on architecture-specific provider wheels. The usual installation command installs the provider set for the selected CUDA and CPU platform; to reduce image size, install only the provider needed for your GPU. If you mirror or vendor wheels, include the provider wheels as well as the shim, and keep their CUDA-specific versions aligned.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;table&gt;
&lt;thead&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;th&gt;Dependency&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;th&gt;0.6.18.post1&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;th&gt;0.7.0&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/thead&gt;
&lt;tbody&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;nvidia-cudnn-frontend&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;&amp;gt;=1.25.0&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;&amp;gt;=1.29.0&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;apache-tvm-ffi&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;&amp;gt;=0.1.6,!=0.1.8,!=0.1.8.post0,&amp;lt;0.2&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;&amp;gt;=0.1.11,&amp;lt;0.2&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;NCCL-EP Python packages&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;nccl4py&amp;gt;=0.3.1&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;nccl4py&amp;gt;=0.4.1&lt;/code&gt; and &lt;code&gt;nccl-extensions&amp;gt;=0.1.0&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;nvidia-cutlass-dsl&lt;/code&gt; through &lt;code&gt;[cu12]&lt;/code&gt; / &lt;code&gt;[cu13]&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;&amp;gt;=4.6.2a0&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;&amp;gt;=4.7.0a0&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/tbody&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The base &lt;code&gt;nvidia-cutlass-dsl&lt;/code&gt; requirement remains &lt;code&gt;&amp;gt;=4.6.2a0&lt;/code&gt;; the CUDA extras have the higher floor. Environments pinned to CUTLASS DSL 4.6.2 need compatible dependency pins before installing those extras.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5147101248&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/flashinfer-ai/flashinfer/issues/4514&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/flashinfer-ai/flashinfer/pull/4514/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/flashinfer-ai/flashinfer/pull/4514&quot;&gt;#4514&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5415248505&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/flashinfer-ai/flashinfer/issues/5096&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/flashinfer-ai/flashinfer/pull/5096/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/flashinfer-ai/flashinfer/pull/5096&quot;&gt;#5096&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5438336835&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/flashinfer-ai/flashinfer/issues/5182&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/flashinfer-ai/flashinfer/pull/5182/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/flashinfer-ai/flashinfer/pull/5182&quot;&gt;#5182&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5379275662&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/flashinfer-ai/flashinfer/issues/5016&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/flashinfer-ai/flashinfer/pull/5016/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/flashinfer-ai/flashinfer/pull/5016&quot;&gt;#5016&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Notice: small-batch FP8 groupwise GEMM&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;g-emoji class=&quot;g-emoji&quot; alias=&quot;warning&quot;&gt;⚠️&lt;/g-emoji&gt; The CUTLASS &lt;code&gt;gemm_fp8_nt_groupwise&lt;/code&gt; path on SM100/SM103 can intermittently produce incorrect output for &lt;code&gt;M &amp;lt;= 32&lt;/code&gt; with &lt;code&gt;scale_granularity_mnk=(1, 128, 128)&lt;/code&gt;. This pre-existing issue remains in 0.7.0; see &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/flashinfer-ai/flashinfer/issues/4396&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;issue&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/flashinfer-ai/flashinfer/issues/4396/hovercard&quot;&gt;#4396&lt;/a&gt; for the investigation. Validate affected workloads before deployment. A different backend requires its own supported shapes and scale layout; there is no documented switch to disable only this CUTLASS fast path.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Notice: API removals and behavior changes&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Update callers of the removed APIs before upgrading:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;table&gt;
&lt;thead&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;th&gt;Removed&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;th&gt;Replacement&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/thead&gt;
&lt;tbody&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;comm.trtllm_custom_all_reduce&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;comm.trtllm_allreduce_fusion&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;comm.trtllm_create_ipc_workspace_for_all_reduce&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;comm.trtllm_create_ipc_workspace_for_all_reduce_fusion&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;BatchDecodeMlaWithPagedKVCacheWrapper&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;mla.BatchMLAPagedAttentionWrapper&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;No-op &lt;code&gt;end_forward()&lt;/code&gt; methods on decode, prefill, sparse, cascade, and POD wrappers&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;Remove the call&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;fused_moe.QuantVariant&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;QuantConfig(variant=...)&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;QuantConfig.from_variant&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;QuantConfig(weight=..., activation=...)&lt;/code&gt; using &lt;code&gt;QuantFormat&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/tbody&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;code&gt;mamba.checkpointing_ssu&lt;/code&gt; replaces the per-step &lt;code&gt;old_x&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;old_B&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;old_dt&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;old_cumAdt&lt;/code&gt;, and &lt;code&gt;cache_buf_idx&lt;/code&gt; arguments with ring-buffer caches (&lt;code&gt;x_cache&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;B_cache&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;dt_cache&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;ring_start&lt;/code&gt;). Update cache allocation and argument binding; the caller-provided &lt;code&gt;out&lt;/code&gt; tensor remains required.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For the TRT-LLM backend of &lt;code&gt;BatchPrefillWithRaggedKVCacheWrapper&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;skip_all_rows_active_check&lt;/code&gt; defaults to &lt;code&gt;True&lt;/code&gt;. Calls on the default fast path must have positive query and KV lengths for every row; pass &lt;code&gt;False&lt;/code&gt; to request device-derived checking when CPU length mirrors are absent.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;code&gt;gated_delta_rule_mtp&lt;/code&gt; still resolves an omitted &lt;code&gt;disable_state_update&lt;/code&gt; to &lt;code&gt;True&lt;/code&gt; in 0.7.0. Pass &lt;code&gt;disable_state_update=True&lt;/code&gt; or &lt;code&gt;False&lt;/code&gt; explicitly to select the intended behavior and suppress the stale warning announcing a change in this release.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5452725480&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/flashinfer-ai/flashinfer/issues/5218&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/flashinfer-ai/flashinfer/pull/5218/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/flashinfer-ai/flashinfer/pull/5218&quot;&gt;#5218&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5399776710&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/flashinfer-ai/flashinfer/issues/5061&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/flashinfer-ai/flashinfer/pull/5061/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/flashinfer-ai/flashinfer/pull/5061&quot;&gt;#5061&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5163846711&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/flashinfer-ai/flashinfer/issues/4545&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/flashinfer-ai/flashinfer/pull/4545/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/flashinfer-ai/flashinfer/pull/4545&quot;&gt;#4545&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5392931135&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/flashinfer-ai/flashinfer/issues/5039&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/flashinfer-ai/flashinfer/pull/5039/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/flashinfer-ai/flashinfer/pull/5039&quot;&gt;#5039&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What&#39;s Changed&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;fix(sampling): reject unsafe multi-CTA top-k launches on low-SM GPUs by &lt;a class=&quot;user-mention notranslate&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;user&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/users/bkryu/hovercard&quot; data-octo-click=&quot;hovercard-link-click&quot; data-octo-dimensions=&quot;link_type:self&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/bkryu&quot;&gt;@bkryu&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5186669868&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/flashinfer-ai/flashinfer/issues/4595&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/flashinfer-ai/flashinfer/pull/4595/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/flashinfer-ai/flashinfer/pull/4595&quot;&gt;#4595&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;feat(cake_kda): optimize small-BH recurrent-KDA prefill by &lt;a class=&quot;user-mention notranslate&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;user&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/users/yyihuang/hovercard&quot; data-octo-click=&quot;hovercard-link-click&quot; data-octo-dimensions=&quot;link_type:self&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/yyihuang&quot;&gt;@yyihuang&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5176369841&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/flashinfer-ai/flashinfer/issues/4571&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/flashinfer-ai/flashinfer/pull/4571/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/flashinfer-ai/flashinfer/pull/4571&quot;&gt;#4571&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;test: enable the unified MoE fuzzer by default and prune legacy UTs by &lt;a class=&quot;user-mention notranslate&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;user&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/users/feih-nv/hovercard&quot; data-octo-click=&quot;hovercard-link-click&quot; data-octo-dimensions=&quot;link_type:self&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/feih-nv&quot;&gt;@feih-nv&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5127835064&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/flashinfer-ai/flashinfer/issues/4475&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/flashinfer-ai/flashinfer/pull/4475/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/flashinfer-ai/flashinfer/pull/4475&quot;&gt;#4475&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;feat(gdn): add pooled state and state checkpointing and dtype support for feature parity by &lt;a class=&quot;user-mention notranslate&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;user&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/users/guangyunh-nv/hovercard&quot; data-octo-click=&quot;hovercard-link-click&quot; data-octo-dimensions=&quot;link_type:self&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/guangyunh-nv&quot;&gt;@guangyunh-nv&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5108639222&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/flashinfer-ai/flashinfer/issues/4436&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/flashinfer-ai/flashinfer/pull/4436/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/flashinfer-ai/flashinfer/pull/4436&quot;&gt;#4436&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
